   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 256,
   "en": "Wh-What a bastard!!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 257,
   "en": "This is bad! At this rate, the base'll be...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 258,
   "en": "Sally, how's the Varga?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 259,
   "en": "Nobody's tampered with it. I can do this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 260,
   "en": "What is that unit...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 261,
   "en": "No <IFF> response, and no registered unit data!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 262,
   "en": "Whoa, don't shoot.@We're here to help you out.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 263,
   "en": "You! What's your affiliation?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 264,
   "en": "Hey, if you keep your eyes on us...",
