   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 265,
   "en": "Tch, what did I tell you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 266,
   "en": "You are... bait... to lure them in.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 267,
   "en": "What is that thing...?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 268,
   "en": "It's just like the Dragous from our myths.@Is that a real creature on this planet?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 269,
   "en": "But doesn't it look kind of mechanical?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 270,
   "en": "Either way, we can't get taken out here.@Let's go, Sally!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 271,
   "en": "Right!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 272,
   "en": "Sieg, the <Steel Dragons> are back!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 273,
   "en": "Geez, where the hell were they?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 274,
   "en": "Tetsuya",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 275,
   "en": "All mobile units, sortie immediately!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 276,
   "en": "Akimi, look at that!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 277,
   "en": "...! Are those two trying to escape?!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 278,
   "en": "What...!?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 279,
   "en": "If we wanted to, we'd have left@this place ages ago!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 280,
   "en": "Y-Yeah, I guess not.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 281,
   "en": "So they were the ones drawing the@Crystal Dragoon and the Lamaris away.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 282,
   "en": "We can't afford to end things here either.@I'd like you to mark us as friendlies already.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 283,
   "en": "Huh, you'll keep fighting with us?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 284,
   "en": "Yeah. That Dragous is your enemy, isn't it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 285,
   "en": "Dragous?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 286,
   "en": "Probably a kind of dragon in their world.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 287,
   "en": "...I said we'll help you.@Are you marking us as friendlies or not? Which is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 288,
   "en": "Commander, I judge that we need their help@to break through this situation.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 289,
   "en": "Miles",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "canon"
  },
  {
   "id": 290,
   "en": "But those two are Gadisword people.@There's no telling when they'll turn@their guns on us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 291,
   "en": "As they said themselves, if they meant to escape,@they'd already have left.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 292,
   "en": "Hmm... Very well, permission granted.@However, if they take hostile action,@stop them by force.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 293,
   "en": "Understood.@All units, identify the Gadisword units as friendly.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 294,
   "en": "So they have come. Then... let us test it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 295,
   "en": "The Crystal Dragoon is bringing@the <Lamaris> with it...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 296,
   "en": "So Debudedabide really did capture them@to use as their own forces!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 297,
   "en": "If the <Dark Brain> remnants can command the Lamaris,@it could seriously hamper our future operations.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 298,
   "en": "Tsugumi",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 299,
   "en": "Because they could send Lamaris anywhere@they want, not just cities...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 300,
   "en": "But there's no proof that Debudedabide and the@others have succeeded in breeding them.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 301,
   "en": "For now, they may still be at the@catch-and-release stage.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 302,
   "en": "True...@If they had many of them, it wouldn't be odd@to deploy them to several places at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 303,
   "en": "But they may mean to eventually.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 304,
   "en": "Then we just hunt down the dragon@before Halloween comes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 305,
   "en": "Haken's right.@All units, destroy the Crystal Dragoon@and the Lamaris!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 306,
   "en": "...So they did not fuse after all.@But the other task... has been fulfilled.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 307,
   "en": "Ah, he ran off!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 308,
   "en": "Eita",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 309,
   "en": "Crystal Dragoon leaving the battle area!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 310,
   "en": "We'll leave pursuit to other units.@All units, quickly sweep up the remaining@enemies on the base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 311,
   "en": "All enemy signals in the combat area are gone!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 312,
   "en": "Where is the Crystal Dragoon headed?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 313,
   "en": "Straight toward two o'clock, elevation...@Ah, we've lost it!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 314,
   "en": "...It pushed less than I expected.@Was it not really trying to crush us?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 315,
   "en": "The Lamaris didn't combine, either...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 316,
   "en": "Yeah, that bugged me too.@Was it because this isn't a densely@populated area, or...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 317,
   "en": "XO, this ship will hold <TD Hovering> at current@altitude. Bring any units needing repair or@resupply back aboard at once.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 318,
   "en": "Sir!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 319,
   "en": "How are the Gadisword units?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 320,
   "en": "Both have landed and stopped.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 321,
   "en": "Order them to disarm.@Then secure the units and the pilots.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 322,
   "en": "Azuki",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 323,
   "en": "Roger. Relaying the message.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 324,
   "en": "Bait... should behave like bait.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 325,
   "en": "On our planet, everyone knows@Dragous are there to be slain!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 326,
   "en": "I finally got to see Fairy!@I can't die in a place like this!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 327,
   "en": "I shall not kill you... yet.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 328,
   "en": "I never imagined those two@would be fighting...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 329,
   "en": "You said things you shouldn't have without@looking at the situation. You'd better apologize later.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 330,
   "en": "Y-Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 331,
   "en": "Before that, we've got to do something@about the Crystal Dragoon and the Lamaris!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 332,
   "en": "I know! Let's go!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 333,
   "en": "It is still too early to judge...@I shall be your opponent.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 334,
   "en": "What those two did will probably@become an issue later.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 335,
   "en": "They're fighting like that even knowing that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 336,
   "en": "Once we get through this, you'd better apologize.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 337,
   "en": "Then we'd better do our part too! Let's go!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 338,
   "en": "Sending Lamaris against us@won't do you any good!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 339,
   "en": "You need only... keep fighting.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 340,
   "en": "Whatever one thinks of their actions,@it's a fact that they saved the base!@We mustn't let that go to waste!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 341,
   "en": "Every possibility... is worth testing.@That one is... no exception.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 342,
   "en": "Hagane: Bridge",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 343,
   "en": "A notice just came from the Joint Chiefs of Staff.@Since the recent attack has left Aviano Base's@security in doubt...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 344,
   "en": "...Sieg Altolied, Sally Emil and their units@will be placed in this ship's custody.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 345,
   "en": "So they'll be decoys, just like@Fairy Klibia and the <Ariard>?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 346,
   "en": "...To put it bluntly, yes.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 347,
   "en": "Then how will the two of them be treated?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 348,
   "en": "As with Fairy Klibia, I'll leave it to you, Major.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 349,
   "en": "Including questioning and analysis of their units,@I take it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 350,
   "en": "Of course. Do not neglect to keep them watched.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 351,
   "en": "Roger.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 352,
   "en": "Hagane - Hangar",
   "kind": "name",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 353,
   "en": "So what are we being charged with?@If it's desertion, I'm filing a complaint.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 354,
   "en": "Your offense is canceled out by your merit@in defending the base.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 355,
   "en": "Really?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 356,
   "en": "Yeah.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 357,
   "en": "Then what happens after this?@Questioning on the base?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 358,
   "en": "No. Like Fairy Klibia, you'll be placed@in custody here on the Hagane.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 359,
   "en": "...!",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 360,
   "en": "Then we can be with Fairy...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 361,
   "en": "As I said before, you'll be under constant@watch, and your movements will be heavily@restricted. You'll each stay in separate rooms.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 362,
   "en": "What about our Leonysis?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 363,
   "en": "It'll be loaded onto the Hagane and analyzed.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 364,
   "en": "(This worked out nicely...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 365,
   "en": "I'm sure you have objections, but I'd like@you to accept this.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 366,
   "en": "...The <Rattma> bunch will come after the Steel@Dragons to get the Ariard back. When it comes@to it, you plan to use us as decoys or shields?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 367,
   "en": "I don't think that would be an effective strategy.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 368,
   "en": "As I said before, I want to avoid conflict@with Gadisword as much as possible.@For that, we need your cooperation...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 369,
   "en": "I intend to respect your position on this ship too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 370,
   "en": "...Got it.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 371,
   "en": "Me too.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 372,
   "en": "Um... excuse me, Major. Are you done talking?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 373,
   "en": "Yes. What is it?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 374,
   "en": "Actually, there's something I want to say@to those two...",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 375,
   "en": "What? You've got no right to complain to us.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 376,
   "en": "Ah, no, it's not that.@I wanted to apologize for earlier.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 377,
   "en": "Huh...?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "tm"
  },
  {
   "id": 378,
   "en": "Um... sorry for doubting you.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 379,
   "en": "You came all this way just to say that?",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 380,
   "en": "Heh heh. You really are a nice guy, Akimi.",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  },
  {
   "id": 381,
   "en": "(Sally...)",
   "kind": "text",
   "keep": false,
   "en_src": "ai"
  }
 ]
}